sequenceDiagram
  actor S as Seller
  participant API as PublishingService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant N as NarrationService
  S->>API: POST /listings {storyId, title, description, priceVnd, aliases}
  API->>DB: seller approved? plan canSell? price 0 or 5,000-500,000 step 1,000?
  API->>DB: load private story (owned, reviewed)
  alt not reviewed or gaps
    API-->>S: 422
  end
  API->>API: aliasErrors + leftoverNameErrors (real names, situation, family moment)
  alt personal info left
    API-->>S: 422 Personal information not fully removed
  end
  API->>DB: BEGIN
  API->>DB: copy story as kind=published (no situation / moment / seed event, aliasName characters)
  API->>DB: copy pages, checkpoints (template trace kept), ready scene images and cover key
  API->>N: queue narration with generic names
  API->>DB: insert listings(submitted) + moderation_reviews(submission)
  API->>DB: COMMIT
  API-->>S: 201 listing
